:fd_alice_traditional a :FamilyDynamic ; rdfs:label "Traditional Family"@en ; :familyStructure "Nuclear family, traditional values" ; :familyRole "Good daughter, conventional, family-oriented" ; :familyAtmosphere "Supportive, conventional expectations" ; :parentalStyle "Traditional, expecting marriage and children" ; :description "Traditional family with conventional expectations. Parents expect marriage, children, stable life. Chastity lifestyle would be incomprehensible to them. This creates split between family self and chastity self. Alice's people-pleasing developed from wanting family approval."@en .

:fd_anne_divorced_servant a :FamilyDynamic ; rdfs:label "Divorced, Household with Servants"@en ; :familyStructure "Single, divorced, household with Beth (servant), Edward (messenger)" ; :familyRole "Mistress of household, dominant over servants" ; :familyAtmosphere "Controlled, hierarchical, BDSM-inflected" ; :parentalStyle "N/A" ; :description "Divorced, runs household with servants (Beth, Edward). Household is site of dominance. Beth is trained servant, Edward is messenger/servant. Household structure mirrors BDSM hierarchy. This is Anne's domain - where she exercises control."@en .

