:fd_nolan_undefined a :FamilyDynamic ; rdfs:label "Undefined Family Background"@en ; :familyStructure "Unknown/estranged" ; :familyRole "Unknown" ; :familyAtmosphere "Unknown" ; :parentalStyle "Unknown" ; :description "Family background intentionally undefined/estranged. May indicate rejection after coming out as BDSM practitioner, or simply that chosen family (BDSM community) has replaced biological family. This creates freedom from traditional expectations but also potential loneliness."@en .

:fe_alice_engagement a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Engagement to Max"@en ; :experienceType "Relational/commitment" ; :experienceAge "26-27" ; :experienceImpact "0.85" ; :experienceMemory "Proposal, ring, planning wedding, excitement about future"@en ; :description "Engagement was joyful commitment. Traditional values made engagement sacred promise. Wedding planning created anticipation. Chastity began as experiment, became permanent. Engagement ring symbolizes commitment, chastity cage symbolizes dedication."@en ; :leadsTo :ds_alice_marriage, :vs_alice_traditional .

:fe_alice_first_chastity a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "First Chastity Experience"@en ; :experienceType "BDSM/chastity" ; :experienceAge "27" ; :experienceImpact "0.9" ; :experienceMemory "First locking, key to Max, initial frustration, commitment to try"@en ; :description "First chastity locking was pivotal. Initial frustration was expected. Giving key to Max was symbolic surrender. Temporary experiment became permanent lifestyle. This experience redefined relationship and sexuality."@en ; :leadsTo :eb_alice_denied, :co_alice_surrendered .

:fe_alice_max_training a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Max's Chastity Training"@en ; :experienceType "BDSM/training" ; :experienceAge "27-28" ; :experienceImpact "0.85" ; :experienceMemory "Extended denial, frustration management, finding new intimacy, commitment deepening"@en ; :description "Max's training extended denial from days to weeks to months. Frustration was intense initially. Gradually found non-sexual intimacy (cuddling, conversation, service). Training transformed relationship from conventional to power exchange."@en ; :leadsTo :cs_alice_chastity_love, :ge_alice_acceptance .

:fe_anne_affair a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "The Affair"@en ; :experienceType "Relational/betrayal" ; :experienceAge "27-28" ; :experienceImpact "0.95" ; :experienceMemory "Secret meetings, guilt, excitement, discovery, devastation"@en ; :description "Affair was transformative and destructive. Initially exciting, then guilt-ridden. Discovery destroyed marriage. This experience is core shame and core identity. Cannot undo it, can only live with consequences. Affair revealed capacity for deception and desire for power."@en ; :leadsTo :sh_anne_betrayal, :rw_anne_guilt .

:fe_anne_divorce a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Divorce and Loss"@en ; :experienceType "Relational/loss" ; :experienceAge "28-29" ; :experienceImpact "0.9" ; :experienceMemory "Legal proceedings, Leo's anger, loss of home, humiliation, regret"@en ; :description "Divorce was humiliating and painful. Leo's anger was frightening. Lost home, status, relationship. This experience created fear of rejection and need for redemption. Divorce was end of one life, beginning of another. Post-divorce Anne is fundamentally different."@en ; :leadsTo :fs_anne_rejection, :ap_anne_fearful .

:fe_anne_first_submission a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "First Submission to Leo (Post-Divorce)"@en ; :experienceType "BDSM/sexual awakening" ; :experienceAge "29-30" ; :experienceImpact "0.85" ; :experienceMemory "First scene after divorce, Leo's dominance, her surrender, feeling of rightness"@en ; :description "First post-divorce submission to Leo was revelatory. Surrender felt like penance and home. Leo's dominance was both punishment and care. This experience established new dynamic: she is both submissive to Leo and dominant over Becky/Beth. Duality is core identity."@en ; :leadsTo :eb_anne_dominant, :rt_anne_dominant_submissive .

:fe_becky_college a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "College Life and Independence"@en ; :experienceType "Developmental/educational" ; :experienceAge "18-20" ; :experienceImpact "0.7" ; :experienceMemory "First time away from home, freedom to explore, uncertainty about major and future, feeling lost without structure"@en ; :description "College provided first taste of independence but also created anxiety from lack of structure. Undeclared major symbolizes broader uncertainty about identity and future. This openness made her receptive to Leo's clear expectations and structure. Training provides clarity that college life lacks."@en ; :leadsTo :rn_becky_structure .

:fe_becky_first_session a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "First Training Session"@en ; :experienceType "BDSM/sexual" ; :experienceAge "20" ; :experienceImpact "0.9" ; :experienceMemory "First flogging, pain mixed with arousal, crying but wanting more, aftercare with Leo, feeling claimed"@en ; :description "First training session was painful but transformative. Discovered capacity for finding pleasure in pain. Leo's aftercare (tenderness following pain) created powerful bonding. This established pattern: pain → aftercare → belonging. Training became path to identity."@en ; :leadsTo :cs_becky_punishment, :ds_becky_surrender .

:fe_becky_meeting_leo a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Meeting Leo at the Tavern"@en ; :experienceType "Relational/sexual awakening" ; :experienceAge "20" ; :experienceImpact "0.95" ; :experienceMemory "First encounter, Leo's stare, feeling seen and known, attraction mixed with fear, curiosity overwhelming caution"@en ; :description "Meeting Leo was transformative. His direct gaze made her feel truly seen for first time. Immediate attraction despite (or because of) his dominance. This encounter awakened submissive orientation that was previously unconscious. Beginning of journey from college student to slave."@en ; :leadsTo :eb_becky_masochistic, :po_becky_submissive .

:fe_beth_anne_submission a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Witnessing Anne's Submission to Leo"@en ; :experienceType "Observational/learning" ; :experienceAge "30s" ; :experienceImpact "0.6" ; :experienceMemory "Seeing Anne submit, surprise, understanding hierarchy"@en ; :description "Observed Anne submitting to Leo. Surprised to see mistress also serves. This established household hierarchy: Leo > Anne > Beth. Understanding her place brought clarity and acceptance."@en ; :leadsTo :cs_beth_invisibility_safety .

