:fe_leo_divorce a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "Divorce from Anne"@en ; :experienceType "Relational/betrayal" ; :experienceAge "28-29" ; :experienceImpact "0.9" ; :experienceMemory "Discovery of affair, legal battle, loss of control, humiliation, anger"@en ; :description "Divorce was devastating betrayal. Anne's affair shattered trust and sense of control. Legal process was chaotic and humiliating. This experience cemented dismissive attachment and need for absolute control in relationships. Paradoxically, post-divorce BDSM relationship with Anne is more honest than marriage."@en ; :leadsTo :ap_leo_dismissive, :fs_leo_chaos .

:fe_leo_first_dom a :FormativeExperience ; rdfs:label "First Dominant Experience"@en ; :experienceType "BDSM/sexual awakening" ; :experienceAge "25" ; :experienceImpact "0.85" ; :experienceMemory "First scene as dominant, partner's surrender, feeling of power and responsibility, clarity of identity"@en ; :description "First dominant experience was revelatory. Partner's surrender felt natural and right. Discovered sadistic orientation - pleasure from inflicting pain (consensually). This was discovery of true nature, not adoption of role. Dominance feels like home, not performance."@en ; :leadsTo :eb_leo_sadistic, :po_leo_dominant .

