:rt_alice_chaste_devotion a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Chaste Devotion Template"@en ; :templateType "Chaste devotion to partner" ; :templateOrigin "Traditional values, Max's training" ; :templateFlexibility "0.5" ; :description "Relational template of chaste devotion. Sexuality is for Max's control, not her expression. Devotion is through denial. Template is moderately flexible - can negotiate releases but fundamentally chaste."@en .

:rt_anne_dominant_submissive a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Dominant-Submissive Template"@en ; :templateType "Dominant over some, submissive to Leo" ; :templateOrigin "Post-divorce power reclaiming, guilt" ; :templateFlexibility "0.5" ; :description "Relational template of dual position: submissive to Leo, dominant over Becky/Beth. This is not contradiction but adaptation. Submission to Leo is penance, dominance over others is power reclaiming. Template is flexible enough to navigate both positions."@en .

