:rt_beth_service a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Service Template"@en ; :templateType "Service/employment" ; :templateOrigin "Economic necessity, class" ; :templateFlexibility "0.3" ; :description "Relational template of service. Always serving, never served. Template is inflexible - cannot imagine being in charge. This limits possibilities but provides clarity."@en .

