:rt_bree_peers a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Peer Relationship Template"@en ; :templateType "Loyal but secretly different" ; :templateOrigin "Friendship with Melissa and Teagan" ; :templateFlexibility "0.5" ; :description "Maintains close friendships but feels secretly different. Melissa and Teagan's traditional views create pressure to conform. Bree doesn't fully share their values but avoids conflict. Octavia represents alternative peer relationship - more authentic, less judgmental."@en .

:rt_edward_submissive_aggressive a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Submissive-Aggressive Template"@en ; :templateType "Ambivalent - submissive then aggressive" ; :templateOrigin "Resentment, powerlessness" ; :templateFlexibility "0.3" ; :description "Relational template of submissive-aggressive oscillation. Complies then resents, explodes. This is unstable pattern. Flexibility is low - trapped in cycle."@en .

:rt_leo_authority a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Authority Template"@en ; :templateType "Authority over others" ; :templateOrigin "Natural dominant orientation, divorce reinforcement" ; :templateFlexibility "0.3" ; :description "Relational template of authority. Always dominant, never submissive. Flexibility is low - cannot imagine being subordinate. All relationships (sexual, professional, social) have hierarchy with Leo at top. This limits intimacy but provides safety."@en .

:rt_max_keyholder a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Keyholder Template"@en ; :templateType "Keyholder over chaste submissive" ; :templateOrigin "Natural control orientation, first experience" ; :templateFlexibility "0.5" ; :description "Relational template of keyholder. Always controls partner's sexuality. Template is moderately flexible - can grant releases but fundamentally controlling. This is only relational mode."@en .

:rt_nolan_authority a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Comfortable Authority Template"@en ; :templateType "Authority figure" ; :templateOrigin "Club ownership, natural dominance" ; :templateFlexibility "0.8" ; :description "Comfortable in authority role. Doesn't apologize for power. Expects respect but doesn't demand it. Authority is earned through competence and care, not intimidation. With Bree, authority is professional (club owner) not personal (potential partner)."@en .

:rt_nolan_guide a :RelationalTemplate ; rdfs:label "Guide/Student Template"@en ; :templateType "Mentor/mentee" ; :templateOrigin "BDSM community mentorship" ; :templateFlexibility "0.7" ; :description "Primary relational template is guide/student. Comfortable in mentor role. This works well for community leadership and educating Bree. Risk is always being the teacher, never the equal. Growth involves allowing relationships where he's not the expert."@en .

:rw_alice_uncertainty a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Uncertainty"@en ; :woundType "Uncertainty/doubt" ; :woundDepth "0.5" ; :woundHealing "0.7" ; :description "Wound around uncertainty about sexual future. Will Max ever release her? Is marriage compatible with chastity? This uncertainty is managed through trust. Healing comes through commitment."@en .

:rw_anne_guilt a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Guilt"@en ; :woundType "Guilt/shame" ; :woundDepth "0.9" ; :woundHealing "0.3" ; :description "Core wound is guilt from affair. This is self-inflicted wound. Guilt shapes identity and relationships. Healing is slow - requires self-forgiveness, not just Leo's. Guilt is both motivator and burden."@en .

:rw_becky_rejection a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Potential Rejection"@en ; :woundType "Rejection/abandonment" ; :woundDepth "0.7" ; :woundHealing "0.6" ; :description "Wound around potential rejection by Leo/Anne. Fears not being good enough, being cast aside. Training progress heals this wound gradually. Consistent aftercare reinforces that she's valued."@en .

