:rw_bree_judgment a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Judgment"@en ; :woundType "Shame/judgment" ; :woundDepth "0.8" ; :woundHealing "0.3" ; :description "Deep wound from being judged for curiosity and natural desires. Religious community, family, and friends all reinforce that certain curiosities are wrong. Expects judgment from Nolan and kink community. Healing requires experiencing non-judgmental acceptance of authentic self."@en .

:rw_edward_rejection a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Rejection"@en ; :woundType "Rejection/social" ; :woundDepth "0.8" ; :woundHealing "0.1" ; :description "Core wound is rejection. Social, romantic, professional. Wound is deep, unhealed. This shapes all interactions. Healing is minimal."@en .

:rw_leo_divorce a :RelationalWound ; rdfs:label "Wound of Betrayal"@en ; :woundType "Betrayal/trust" ; :woundDepth "0.8" ; :woundHealing "0.4" ; :description "Core wound is betrayal by Anne. Trust was shattered, never fully healed. This wound shapes all relationships. Hypervigilance for betrayal. BDSM dynamic with Anne is attempt to heal through re-enactment with different power balance."@en .

