:sc_bree_journalist a :SelfConcept ; rdfs:label "Professional Journalist Identity"@en ; :selfConceptContent "I am a serious investigative journalist who pursues truth regardless of personal discomfort" ; :selfConceptClarity "0.8" ; :selfConceptStability "0.7" ; :description "Strong professional identity as truth-seeking journalist. This identity is more developed than personal/sexual identity. Provides sense of purpose and competence. Can be used defensively ('I'm just doing my job') but also enables growth through professional curiosity."@en .

