    :agent :c_elizabeth ;
    :patient :c_elizabeth ;
    :time "18 months later" ;
    :location "Indian Ocean Island" ;
    :description "Elizabeth swims out to sea after being shot with Fixer-2 darts. She becomes a mermaid, living alone on an island in the Indian Ocean."@en .

## Themes - Hell Hath No Fury

:theme_geneticTransformation a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Genetic Transformation"@en ;
    :description "DNA-altering drug that can transform any person into another, changing physical form but not mind. Creates questions of identity and what makes us who we are."@en .

:theme_femdom a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Female Domination"@en ;
    :description "Elizabeth's elaborate revenge involves controlling Matthew's transformation and forcing him to become her physically. Power dynamics shift as he becomes the object of her vengeance."@en .

:theme_vengeance a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Elaborate Vengeance"@en ;
    :description "A woman scorned at the altar plans an intricate three-year revenge, involving kidnapping, genetic transformation, slavery, and murder. 'Hell hath no fury like a woman scorned.'"@en .

:theme_identity a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Identity and Self"@en ;
    :description "Characters struggle with being trapped in bodies that don't match their sense of self. Matthew becoming Elizabeth physically but still feeling male inside creates profound identity crisis."@en .

:theme_bodySwap a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Body Swapping"@en ;
    :description "Multiple instances of people being transformed into others' bodies - Matthew into Elizabeth, John into Jane, Elizabeth into Kat, James into Cathline. Questions of who is the 'real' person."@en .

:theme_slavery a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Sexual Slavery"@en ;
    :description "The Guild traffics women into sexual slavery. Cathline is sold to a harem, Kat is prepared for sale. Dark themes of non-consensual captivity."@en .

:theme_revengeCycle a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Revenge Cycle"@en ;
    :description "Elizabeth's revenge drives her to become as cruel as what she suffered. The cycle of vengeance destroys multiple lives and ultimately isolates everyone."@en .

:theme_loveObsession a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Love as Obsession"@en ;
    :description "Elizabeth's love for Matthew curdles into obsession and vengeance. Her actions show love turned toxic, willing to destroy the object of her affection to 'have' him."@en .

## NarrativeWork - Hell Hath No Fury

:work_hellHathNoFury a :NarrativeWork ;
    rdfs:label "Hell Hath No Fury"@en ;
    :author "Darkside@nym.alias.net"@en ;
    :description "Hell Hath No Fury - Narrative work in the unified ontology."@en ;
    :sourcePath "books/work_hellHathNoFury.ttl" ;
    :language "en" .

## Devices/Protocols - Hell Hath No Fury

:dev_dnaDrug a :Device ;
    rdfs:label "DNA Alteration Drug"@en ;
    :description "Elixir that rewrites DNA, changing physical form. Administered via pills or powder. Each pill changes a specific body part. Effects can be permanent unless antidote is given within timeframe."@en .

:dev_fixer a :Device ;
    rdfs:label "Fixer Agent"@en ;
    :description "Protein that prevents further genetic changes, making transformations permanent. Applied to ensure changes cannot be undone."@en .

:dev_failSafe a :Device ;
    rdfs:label "Fail-Safe Mind Control"@en ;
    :description "Subconscious programming activated by trigger phrases. Freezes the subject or induces pleasure/orgasm. Elizabeth installed multiple fail-safes in Matthew."@en .

:dev_hydraTattoo a :Device ;
    rdfs:label "Hydra Tattoo"@en ;
    :description "Elaborate tattoo covering the body. Part of Elizabeth's riddle - the indelible mark that leads to pleasure and pain. Used for identification."@en .

:proto_pillSequence a :Protocol ;
    rdfs:label "Pill Transformation Protocol"@en ;
    :description "Ten pills that transform body parts sequentially. Pills 1-2: breasts/vagina, 3-4: legs, 5-6: body/hips, 7-8: arms, 9: face/voice, 10: final completion. The 'decoy' pill was actually the antidote."@en .

:proto_narcotic a :Protocol ;
    rdfs:label "Addiction Narco-Protocol"@en ;
    :description "Drug built into the transformation pills causes physical dependency. Creates craving that forces victim to take more pills. Psychologically manipulates thinking."@en .

## ParticipantDynamics

:pd_geneticTransformation a :ParticipantDynamic ;
    rdfs:label "Genetic Transformation Dynamics"@en ;
    :description "The power dynamic where Elizabeth controls who gets transformed, when, and how. Victim has no agency over their own body."@en .

:pd_vengeance a :ParticipantDynamic ;
    rdfs:label "Vengeance Dynamics"@en ;
    :description "Elizabeth orchestrates events, giving her immense power over multiple lives. Her victims are pawns in her elaborate plan."@en .

:pd_slavery a :ParticipantDynamic ;
    rdfs:label "Slavery and Trafficking Dynamics"@en ;
    :description "The Guild's activities create slave/owner dynamics. Women are sold, branded, and used as property."@en .

## Locations

:v_luxorHotel a :Venue ;
    rdfs:label "Luxor Hotel, Egypt"@en ;
    :venueType "hotel" ;
