:theme_powerExchange a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Power Exchange"@en ;
    :description "The surrender of all power and authority from the slave to the Master. The Master gains absolute control over the slave's body, actions, and punishment. The slave loses autonomy, voice, and identity. Represented in the Agreement's clause: 'the Slave agrees that henceforth the Slave will irrevocably surrender all freedoms, all choices, and the Slave's given name, to the Master.'"@en .

