:theme_transformation a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Transformation"@en ;
    :description "The desire for a new, different life. The ceremony represents the death of the old self and the birth of the new. The dark room is the literal threshold between identities. The slave must leave behind her given name, her autonomy, and her old life to become someone new."@en .

:theme_institutionalControl a :Theme ;
    rdfs:label "Institutional Control"@en ;
    :description "The Personnel Development Corporation (PDC) represents institutional authority in slave training. The Agreement is between the slave and the PDC and its designated agent. The Master operates as an institutional representative, not just an individual. The slave has no legal rights or recourse."@en .

