# MilestoneEvents from The Politics Of Ponygirls

:me_boardMeeting a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Board Meeting - Gymkhana Logistics Crisis"@en ;
    :agent :c_leo ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "Before Gymkhana event" ;
    :location "Arizona Community executive restaurant" ;
    :description "Leo discusses Gymkhana logistics problem with board. 300+ registrants all bringing ponygirls, insufficient cells. Alice proposes community career path solution giving ponies privileges (days off, vacations) in exchange for commitment allowing doubled-up cells."@en .

:me_fbiRaid a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "FBI Raid on Donaldson Ponygirl Hideout"@en ;
    :agent :c_wilbur ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "Day of raid" ;
    :location "Donaldson family ponygirl hideout" ;
    :description "FBI raids illegal ponygirl hideout. Fran panics and triggers alarm. Security extracts Fran via breather mask with sleepy gas and teleport. Jeannine gets six ponies out, FBI finds only six in cells. Political negotiations follow."@en .

:me_communityCareerPathProposal a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Alice Proposes Community Career Path"@en ;
    :agent :c_alice ;
    :patient :c_prettyLemon ;
    :time "During board meeting" ;
    :location "Arizona Community executive restaurant" ;
    :description "Alice proposes giving community-owned ponies career path and eventual absorption into community when too old to race. Trade: complete commitment to community lifestyle for privileges like days off and vacations. Pretty Lemon supports with lobo-ra strike precedent."@en .

:me_timeDilationSetup a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Time Dilation Cell Block Setup"@en ;
    :agent :c_alice ;
    :patient :c_prettyLemon ;
    :time "Two weeks before Gymkhana" ;
    :location "Unused cavern, Arizona Community" ;
    :description "Alice and Pretty Lemon use time dilation (time runs slower by factor of several thousand) to solve cell shortage. Five cellblocks cleared, 250 community ponies put to sleep with gas and teleported in. Frees up cells for guests. Restoration happens a week after event."@en .

:me_franArrives a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Fran Arrives at Arizona Community"@en ;
    :agent :c_fran ;
    :patient :c_greenRivers ;
    :time "Week early due to raid" ;
    :location "Arizona Community warehouse/teleport area" ;
    :description "Fran arrives a week early due to FBI raid. Green Rivers assigned as her guide. Gets executive apartment in same building as Pretty Lemon. Learns transport system for Gymkhana."@en .

:me_regulationSMeeting a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Regulation S Compliance Meeting"@en ;
    :agent :c_leo ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "Day before Gymkhana" ;
    :location "Arizona Community executive offices" ;
    :description "Meeting with Senator McWhip, FBI agent Sharon, Horst (German), McNab (English) about getting ponygirl operations into compliance with Consensual Slavery Acts. Frank discussion of recruiting, training, sale, conditions, and legal requirements."@en .

:me_gymkhanaEvent a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "International Gymkhana Ponygirl Event"@en ;
    :agent :c_leo ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "Gymkhana week" ;
    :location "Arizona Community arena and track" ;
    :description "International ponygirl event with hundreds of registrants. Races include heavy sulky racing, dressage competitions, endurance races. Fran races Dreammaker to third place with help from trainer Donna."@en .

:me_carrieArrest a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Carrie McWhip's Arrest and Training Pickup"@en ;
    :agent :c_senatorMcWhip ;
    :patient :c_carrie ;
    :time "During Gymkhana" ;
    :location "McWhip apartment" ;
    :description "Security has had enough of Carrie's antics. Fran calls Security, arranges training pickup. Fran stuns Carrie with prod, security wraps her up in leather belt, cuffs, hobble chain, gag. Senator agrees to let Fran take her for training."@en .

:me_carrieOrientation a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Carrie's Ponygirl Orientation"@en ;
    :agent :c_shaman ;
    :patient :c_carrie ;
    :time "Night of arrest" ;
    :location "Orientation room, Arizona Community" ;
    :description "Carrie undergoes full ponygirl transformation. Stripped, ear tags punched in (neat sixteenth inch holes), breast rings installed (permanent, thick), ball gag installed. Molly does professional piercings with topical anesthetic. Gets blanket and wheeled to cell on stand."@en .

:me_fransTrainingWithDonna a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Fran Trains Dreammaker for Racing"@en ;
    :agent :c_donna ;
    :patient :c_dreammaker ;
    :time "Days before race" ;
    :location "Arizona Community track" ;
    :description "Fran works with Donna learning to train Dreammaker. Four-hour sessions covering start motion, trotting booth, cart work, rein work with whip, final turn to judges stand. Dreammaker improves from form 4 to 8-8.5. Fran learns proper whip technique."@en .

:me_heavySulkyRace a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Fran and Dreammaker Race (Third Place)"@en ;
    :agent :c_fran ;
    :patient :c_dreammaker ;
    :time "Gymkhana race day" ;
    :location "Arizona Community track" ;
    :description "Fran drives Dreammaker in heavy sulky race (post position 8 of 10). Uses non-standard anal buzzer signal Dreammaker remembers. Finishes fourth on track but third on form, earning third place overall. Donna's prod behind Fran helps focus."@en .

:me_sharonAccessIssue a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon's Access Problem Resolved"@en ;
    :agent :c_fran ;
    :patient :c_sharon ;
    :time "After races" ;
    :location "Executive block guard station" ;
    :description "Sharon has authorization problems accessing executive block needed for investigation. Fran marches her up to security, calls Leo to get proper clearance. Gets class 2 access with Leo's personal authority. Security chief had blocked without checking full dossier."@en .

:me_ownersMeeting a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "All Owners Meeting on Compliance"@en ;
    :agent :c_leo ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "After Gymkhana" ;
    :location "Arizona Community" ;
    :description "Leo holds all US (expanded to EC) owners meeting on getting into compliance with Consensual Slavery Acts. Horst and McNab bring EC perspective. Discussion of documentation, mainlining, language problems with non-English speaking ponies."@en .

:me_sharonUnravels a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon's Breakdown and Recovery Plan"@en ;
    :agent :c_sharon ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "After Gymkhana" ;
    :location "Fran's apartment" ;
    :description "Sharon comes apart after Gymkhana ends. Undercover work made her too submissive, couldn't stay dominant around Fran without other agents grounding her. Fran lays down rules (not contract, not submissive), offers indenture as solution. Sharon eventually accepts."@en .

:me_sharonSignsIndenture a :MilestoneEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon Signs Indenture with Fran"@en ;
    :agent :c_sharon ;
    :patient :c_fran ;
    :time "Weeks after Gymkhana" ;
    :location "Fran's location" ;
