:protocol_teleportTransport a :Protocol ;
    rdfs:label "Teleport Transport Protocol"@en ;
    :description "Guests brought to teleport stage, given sleepy gas, transported to Arizona Community warehouse, greeter meets them with cart. For organized groups: cell phone instructions, button push, arrival with greeter. For VIPs: Alice, Lemon, Raindance or Fran port out to help."@en ;
    :fromSource :work_politicsPonygirls .

